        "title": "New iPhone Duo orders now deliver a month earlier than before",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/new-iphone-duo-orders-now-deliver-a-month-earlier-than-before/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Interested in getting an iPhone Duo before Christmas? You might be in luck, as Apple’s online store delivery estimates just got pulled forward by a full month, with December delivery now expected.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080526\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/new-iphone-duo-orders-now-deliver-a-month-earlier-than-before/#more-1080526\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
