        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apple-has-15-new-products-coming-in-2027-per-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/john-ternus-macbook-pro-proled-xdr.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple just wrapped up a very busy product launch season, but a <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-15/apple-siri-ai-app-integrations-power-smart-glasses-iphone-duo-2-face-id-plan?srnd=undefined\">new report</a> offers a sneak peek at the 15+ new products coming in 2027.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080155\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apple-has-15-new-products-coming-in-2027-per-report/#more-1080155\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
