        "title": "ChatGPT Health feature will soon work with Mac app, Dots, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/chatgpt-health-feature-will-soon-work-with-mac-app-dots-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/01/apple-health-chatgpt.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">OpenAI <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/23/openai-relaunches-apple-health-connected-chatgpt-feature-with-expanded-access/\">relaunched</a> its ChatGPT Health feature over the summer after piloting earlier in the year. Next, ChatGPT Health is set to expand to more platforms, including the Mac app and more.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080154\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/chatgpt-health-feature-will-soon-work-with-mac-app-dots-more/#more-1080154\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
