        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/grok-bot-for-mac-adds-integration-with-apple-mail-messages-notes-and-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/grokbot.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grok Bot for Mac just gained a bunch of new Apple integrations, including Messages, Mail, Notes, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,grok-bot,icloud,mac\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079213\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/grok-bot-for-mac-adds-integration-with-apple-mail-messages-notes-and-more/#more-1079213\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
