        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-notes-adds-a-powerful-new-advantage-in-ios-27-3/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/notes-app-icon-ios-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There’s no shortage of note-taking apps on the App Store, but Apple Notes has long been my favorite, and in iOS 27.3 it’s gaining a new advantage: extensive app controls via Siri AI.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-notes,ios-27,ios-27-3\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079085\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-notes-adds-a-powerful-new-advantage-in-ios-27-3/#more-1079085\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
