        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-home-collection-accessories-available-for-pre-order-this-friday/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/apple-home-collection-lg-schneider.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple’s new HomeView (<a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-homeview-review-an-adorable-smart-display-that-earns-its-place/\">review here</a>) and Apple TV 4K (<a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-tv-4k-review-the-best-streamer-comes-at-a-cost/\">review</a>) arrive in stores this Friday, November 13. And that same day, the first Apple Home Collection accessories will be available for pre-order.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-home,apple-home-collection\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079012\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-home-collection-accessories-available-for-pre-order-this-friday/#more-1079012\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
