        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/jensen-huang-nvidia.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Jensen Huang has resigned as the CEO of Nvidia following recent reports of extramarital affairs, including one involving a woman suspected of spying for China. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"nvidia\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078892\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/jensen-huang-resigns-as-ceo-of-nvidia/#more-1078892\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
