        "url": "https://longreads.com/2026/11/05/time-capsules-ashley-stimpson/",
        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"619\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?fit=1024%2C619&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?w=2530&amp;ssl=1 2530w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=300%2C181&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=1024%2C619&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=768%2C464&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=1536%2C929&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=2048%2C1239&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=1200%2C726&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=2000%2C1209&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=780%2C472&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=400%2C242&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?resize=706%2C427&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?w=2340&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/BTE-L.png?fit=1024%2C619&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>The future doesn’t care about your time capsule, but don’t let that stop you.",
