        "content_text": "<p>It will be years until NASA is ready for a journey to the red planet, but if Earth continues to suffer from climate change, Mars could come to us.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://psmag.com/social-justice/the-farms-of-the-future-were-built-for-outer-space-will-they-work-on-earth/\">The Farms of the Future Were Built for Outer Space. Will They Work on Earth?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://psmag.com\">Pacific Standard</a>.</p>",
