        "title": "Apple’s leadership overhaul continues with new Apple Pay and Wallet chief",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apples-leadership-overhaul-continues-with-new-apple-pay-and-wallet-chief/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-pay.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-16/apple-taps-26-year-veteran-corey-fugman-to-run-pay-card-and-wallet-services\"><em>Bloomberg</em></a> reports that Apple lifer Corey Fugman will replace Jennifer Bailey as the head of the Apple Pay and Wallet division. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,apple-pay\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080534\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apples-leadership-overhaul-continues-with-new-apple-pay-and-wallet-chief/#more-1080534\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
