        "title": "Apple releases beautiful new iPhone wallpapers featuring Pokémon, download here",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apple-releases-beautiful-new-iphone-wallpapers-featuring-pokemon-download-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/apple-Pokemon-wallpaper-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is celebrating the 30th anniversary of Pokémon with a collection of original wallpapers for iPhone. There are four total, including one designed for iPhone Duo.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1080419\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/16/apple-releases-beautiful-new-iphone-wallpapers-featuring-pokemon-download-here/#more-1080419\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
