        "title": "Perplexity brings AI agents feature called Teammates to the Mac",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/13/perplexity-brings-ai-agents-feature-called-teammates-to-the-mac/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/perplexity-mac-app.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This week, Perplexity has deployed its new proactive agentic AI feature called Teammates to the Mac. Perplexity Teammates were previously limited to iOS and the web.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,mac,perplexity\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079577\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/13/perplexity-brings-ai-agents-feature-called-teammates-to-the-mac/#more-1079577\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
