        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/android-xr-intelligent-eyewear-warby-parker-34.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google today <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/?p=736529\">announced</a> Android XR audio glasses called Intelligent Eyewear that notably support iOS with Made for iPhone certification.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"android-xr,ios\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1079019\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/12/google-glasses-iphone-support/#more-1079019\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
