        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/05/iphone-7-plus-trade-in-value.png?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has once again adjusted the trade-in values for some of its devices, while adding several Samsung foldables to the list. Here are the new values.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078973\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/apple-adjusts-iphone-and-apple-watch-trade-in-values-adds-samsung-foldables/#more-1078973\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
