        "title": "Peacock thinks vertical video will make you watch one more hour per month",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/peacock-thinks-vertical-video-will-make-you-watch-one-more-hour-per-month/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Peacock-thinks-vertical-video-will-make-you-watch-one-more-hour-per-month.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NBCUniversal has announced what it describes as the largest mobile update ever to the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/peacock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Peacock</a> iPhone app, with a bigger emphasis on vertical video. The company reportedly expects this to increase average usage of the app by one hour per user per month …</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,peacock\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1078972\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/12/peacock-thinks-vertical-video-will-make-you-watch-one-more-hour-per-month/#more-1078972\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
